0,Sisaala language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sisaala_language,Sisaala is a Gur language cluster spoken in northern Ghana near the town of Tumu and in the neighbouring republic of Burkina Faso. Western Sisaala is intermediate between Sisaali and Tumulung Sisaala.,"Sisaala, Tumulung",Niger-Congo
